{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f5dd194f980d31da0f711a6a5b576e6cf1f31441f88154d153816455b7615c16", "ja": "（のり子の新しい衣装が届いた。ブログを見た限り、\n気に入ってるみたいだけど……本人の様子はどうかな）", "zh": "（法子的新服装送来了。看她部落格的文章，\n应该是很喜欢……但不知道她本人有什么反应？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "8549a583bca47faaaf653ce67a317ef58f806423bedde43ee540b0e7d2431ea0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nこの衣装、ホントにありがとう！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n真的很谢谢你帮我准备这套服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "68b9d59dd56627da632318a511eee2aa40fc978e69b745c57db6d1d1386d9af4", "ja": "こんなスゴい衣装もらったら、アタシ、\n何かお返ししなくちゃって気になっちゃうよ……。", "zh": "收到这么棒的服装，\n我觉得一定要表示点谢意才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "d82564791081961fa8048291b690295a9c08908c2f1696de7ace0e933023f7f8", "ja": "ねぇ{$P$}、何かアタシに\nしてほしいコトない？　遠慮しないで言って！", "zh": "{$P$}，我问你，\n有没有什么事情需要我帮忙？不用客气，尽管说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7f05f35b12157bb1aee5488e79a3bd24c0022b43ff216e2d6c241adea97c0cba", "ja": "いやいや。のり子がそうやって喜んでいるところを\n見られただけで、プロデューサーとしては十分だよ。", "zh": "不用啦。光是看到法子这么开心，\n身为制作人就已经十分满足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "f89ac5855fc54e99cadcb39f726b893f3ea0a8318f1af20315a1dbac6a70684a", "ja": "ええーっ！？　もう{$P$}ってば、\nそんなコト言わないで、ちゃんと教えてよ～。", "zh": "不会吧──！？{$P$}你真是的，\n别跟我客气，尽管说出来嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "e3c66c3c2fedfd0c0544b5cf3c67a53b8b68a1d1b7826ebbac6a184f1ae0cd41", "ja": "アタシの気持ち、ホントにちゃんと伝わってるの？", "zh": "我的心意，真的有确实传达出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f5e482b2d3a1d8fae9546a4482b759c8ec216ba6cec15b654282fe76ed4e1e55", "ja": "ちゃんと伝わってるぞ？　……いや、まてよ？\nやっぱり、ちゃんと伝わってないのかも……。", "zh": "有啊……不对，等一下。\n或许并没有传达到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "f410764acfa8b16944f132a668f6fd56ab7505474b1ec01840f971fb3d52bb6a", "ja": "えっ。ウソ、やっぱり！？", "zh": "什么？不会吧？真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5ba804189e07cf238ae6c10465bebfb60625f8c24a95be69c1c46ef9c496c465", "ja": "いや、俺じゃなくて。\nのり子自身に、伝わってないんじゃないかって。", "zh": "不，我是有感受到你的心意，\n但我觉得法子你自己却没有感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5fb59cdfa8e1a315dc908ecd94660dc84fc45cdf35f65e26057246f45037df74", "ja": "その衣装は、のり子がアイドルになって、努力した\n結果……つまり、自分自身で勝ち得たものだからな。", "zh": "那套服装是法子成为偶像后，努力打拚得到的成果……\n也就是说，那是你靠自己争取来的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b8960a199ca156a27cad9e156c2e66923e1c868bc4b39b947391d5350b2e8ba", "ja": "この衣装を……アタシが、自分で……？", "zh": "这套服装……是我自己争取的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7d205aca719cc9545e37e25a723d5ac5ffe08d2f78a97b12e84bd9665de1a3d1", "ja": "そう。だからのり子が着るのは当たり前だって事だよ。\n俺は衣装を着たのり子を見られれば、それでいいんだ。", "zh": "没错，所以它穿在法子身上是理所当然的。\n而我只要看到你穿着这套服装就满足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "b7ee43058fb04caa6d35c11b2b1b61765185fe1eb529c8ffdd7275e003dd3304", "ja": "{$P$}ってば……。\nうう……照れるけど、でも、すっごく嬉しい……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你也真是的……\n呜呜……真难为情，不过，我好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "8c5cda4abbb6c9ec4cc70a0460302f095376dcca77d2a94da4ee6ade9898f0a3", "ja": "あっ！　つまり……うん、そっか！\n{$P$}、アタシわかったかも♪", "zh": "啊！这么说……嗯，我懂了！\n{$P$}，我好像知道了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c09aa5d6bb7ae914b6298abdcd756c9b65a8fba4a791f222b060ad5e337c0323", "ja": "わかったって……何がだ？", "zh": "知道了……知道什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "b81a39e77d004933bc22ca34f882a5b0f5ee202470d6e4f08959b4e0940f3821", "ja": "アタシをプロデュースして、こんな衣装着られるまでに\n成長させてくれたのは{$P$}でしょ？", "zh": "努力培育我，让我成长到配得上这套服装的人，\n不就是{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "dd1dded6cf66c8336ff9a2ab7aaf766004ccceb5538280d1dfad4885306b9f1c", "ja": "だからこのアタシは、まるごと全部、\n{$P$}が勝ち取ったものってコト！", "zh": "所以我至今得到的所有成果，\n都算是{$P$}争取来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e0d2fd4ffdf97d002bc4d3fa3191169ebe5d37d9a7a16493938ca38068dde465", "ja": "……そ、そうだな。そういう事になるな……。", "zh": "……这、这么说来，确实是这样啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0054_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "161a62022b174b743324e2b7328598a9b6d0f84496e5be11cc332ba457a0260a", "ja": "だからこれからも、責任持ってプロデュース……あれ？\nどしたの、顔隠しちゃったりして。おーい？", "zh": "所以你要负起责任，继续培育我……咦？\n怎么了？干嘛把脸遮起来？喂～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
